WEBVTT

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:04.140
This is a blessing."

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:06.795
There was no audible voice, but my father

00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:09.843
called out my name powerfully.

00:02:09.843 --> 00:02:12.935
Just 72 hours after his stroke,

00:02:12.935 --> 00:02:14.690
he had already embraced

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:18.165
the totality of his condition.

00:02:18.165 --> 00:02:20.665
Despite his extreme physical state,

00:02:20.665 --> 00:02:23.621
he was completely present with me,

00:02:23.621 --> 00:02:26.253
guiding, nurturing,

00:02:26.253 --> 00:02:28.503
and being my father as much

00:02:28.503 --> 00:02:31.739
if not more than ever before.